<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/W3RC9990CUB/TigerShark_QC_Robotic_Cleaner_RC9990CUB_LEFT_3561.png"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Hayward TigerShark QC Review - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="Known for its durability and quick cleaning cycle. A workhorse for larger pools."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Hayward-TigerShark-QC"/><meta property="og:title" content="Hayward TigerShark QC Review"/><meta property="og:description" content="Known for its durability and quick cleaning cycle. A workhorse for larger pools."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/W3RC9990CUB/TigerShark_QC_Robotic_Cleaner_RC9990CUB_LEFT_3561.png"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="mb-3">Hayward TigerShark QC<!-- -->: In-Depth Review</h1><div class="text-center mb-4 p-3 bg-white rounded border" style="height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/W3RC9990CUB/TigerShark_QC_Robotic_Cleaner_RC9990CUB_LEFT_3561.png" alt="Hayward TigerShark QC" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;width:auto;height:auto"/></div><p class="lead">The Hayward TigerShark QC (Quick Clean) is the tank of the robotic pool cleaner world. It has been around for years and has earned a reputation for being virtually indestructible. While it lacks the sleek looks and smart features of newer models, it makes up for it with raw durability and a simple, effective cleaning cycle that gets the job done year after year.</p><h3 class="mt-5">Who This Is For</h3><div><p>The TigerShark is built for:</p><ul><li>Owners who value <strong>longevity and durability</strong> above all else.</li><li>Pools with <strong>heavy debris</strong> that might damage flimsier robots.</li><li>Those who want a fast cleaning option (90-minute Quick Clean cycle).</li><li>Users who prefer a simple cartridge system over bags.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Who Should Skip It</h3><div><p>Pass on this if:</p><ul><li><strong>You have a bad back:</strong> This unit is heavy (over 21 lbs) and holds water, making it tough to pull out.</li><li><strong>You want smart features:</strong> It's old-school technology. No apps, no Wi-Fi.</li><li><strong>You have a vinyl liner:</strong> While it works, its aggressive tracks are better suited for gunite.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Key Features</h3><div><ul><li><strong>Quick Clean Mode:</strong> 90-minute rapid cycle for fast touch-ups.</li><li><strong>Intelligent Microprocessor:</strong> Learns your pool's size for an efficient cleaning pattern.</li><li><strong>Powerful Vacuum:</strong> On-board pump sucks up debris while scrubbing brushes clean the surface.</li><li><strong>Reinforced Cartridges:</strong> Durable filter elements that last longer than standard mesh.</li><li><strong>3-Hour Standard Cycle:</strong> Deep cleaning mode for floors, walls, and waterline.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Detailed Analysis</h3><div><p><strong>Built to Last:</strong> The TigerShark feels substantial. The plastic is thick, the tracks are heavy-duty, and the internal motor is sealed tight. It's not uncommon to hear of TigerSharks lasting 7-10 years with minimal maintenance, which is rare in the world of pool robotics.</p><p><strong>Quick Clean Cycle:</strong> The 'QC' stands for Quick Clean. This mode allows the robot to perform a rapid 90-minute cleaning cycle, perfect for touch-ups before a party. The standard cycle is 3 hours and covers every inch of the pool, including walls and the waterline.</p><p><strong>Filtration:</strong> It uses a reinforced cartridge filter that slides out from the bottom. While bottom-access filters are less convenient than top-load ones (you have to flip the robot over), the TigerShark's filters are huge and easy to hose off. They trap everything from leaves to fine silt.</p></div><div class="row mt-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-success h-100"><div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Pros</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Legendary durability and build quality</li><li class="list-group-item">Quick Clean cycle is a great time-saver</li><li class="list-group-item">Excellent climbing ability on gunite pools</li><li class="list-group-item">Simple, mechanical operation with few failure points</li><li class="list-group-item">Filters are easy to clean once removed</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-danger h-100"><div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Cons</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Heavy and difficult to remove from the pool</li><li class="list-group-item">Bottom-access filters are inconvenient</li><li class="list-group-item">Dated design compared to modern competitors</li><li class="list-group-item">Can be rough on vinyl liners</li></ul></div></div></div><h3 class="mt-5">Final Verdict</h3><p>The Hayward TigerShark QC is an oldie but a goodie. It&#x27;s the pickup truck of pool cleaners—not pretty, not smart, but it works hard and lasts forever. If you are tired of replacing flimsy plastic robots every two years, the TigerShark is a refreshing change of pace. Just be prepared for a bit of a workout when lifting it out of the water.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card sticky-top" style="top:20px"><div class="card-body text-center"><h5 class="card-title">Hayward TigerShark QC</h5><p class="card-text">Ready to buy? Get the best price online.</p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SS4G926?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 ">Check Price on Amazon</a><small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</small></div><div class="card mt-4"><div class="card-header bg-light fw-bold">Consider These Alternatives</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Hayward-SharkVac-XL">Hayward SharkVac XL</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1599</span></li><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->799</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);s