nd waterline.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Detailed Analysis\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt to Last:\u003c/strong\u003e The TigerShark feels substantial. The plastic is thick, the tracks are heavy-duty, and the internal motor is sealed tight. It's not uncommon to hear of TigerSharks lasting 7-10 years with minimal maintenance, which is rare in the world of pool robotics.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Clean Cycle:\u003c/strong\u003e The 'QC' stands for Quick Clean. This mode allows the robot to perform a rapid 90-minute cleaning cycle, perfect for touch-ups before a party. The standard cycle is 3 hours and covers every inch of the pool, including walls and the waterline.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFiltration:\u003c/strong\u003e It uses a reinforced cartridge filter that slides out from the bottom. While bottom-access filters are less convenient than top-load ones (you have to flip the robot over), the TigerShark's filters are huge and easy to hose off. They trap everything from leaves to fine silt.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-success h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-success text-white\",\"children\":\"Pros\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Legendary durability and build quality\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Quick Clean cycle is a great time-saver\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Excellent climbing ability on gunite pools\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Simple, mechanical operation with few failure points\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Filters are easy to clean once removed\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-danger h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-danger text-white\",\"children\":\"Cons\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Heavy and difficult to remove from the pool\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Bottom-access filters are inconvenient\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Dated design compared to modern competitors\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Can be rough on vinyl liners\"}]]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Final Verdict\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The Hayward TigerShark QC is an oldie but a goodie. It's the pickup truck of pool cleaners—not pretty, not smart, but it works hard and lasts forever. If you are tired of replacing flimsy plastic robots every two years, the TigerShark is a refreshing change of pace. Just be prepared for a bit of a workout when lifting it out of the water.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-lg-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card sticky-top\",\"style\":{\"top\":\"20px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-body text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"className\":\"card-title\",\"children\":\"Hayward TigerShark QC\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"card-text\",\"children\":\"Ready to buy? Get the best price online.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SS4G926?tag=scorpiusllc-20\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 \",\"children\":\"Check Price on Amazon\"}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted d-block mt-2\",\"children\":\"We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-light fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Consider These Alternatives\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Hayward-SharkVac-XL\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/reviews/Hayward-SharkVac-XL\",\"className\":\"text-decoration-none fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Hayward SharkVac XL\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"badge bg-secondary rounded-pill\",\"children\":[\"$$\",1599]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus\",\"className\":\"text-decoration-none fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"badge bg-secondary rounded-pill\",\"children\":[\"$$\",799]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}],null],\"segment\":\"__PAGE__?{\\\"sku\\\":\\\"Hayward-TigerShark-QC\\\"}\"},\"styles\":null}],\"segment\":[\"sku\",\"Hayward-TigerShark-QC\",\"d\"]},\"styles\":null}],null],\"segment\":\"reviews\"},\"styles\":null}]}],[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-1\",\"children\":[\"© \",2026,\" \",\"The Pool Lab\",\". All rights reserved.\"]}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white-50\",\"children\":[\"The Pool Lab\",\" is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.\"]}],[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"$Lc\",null,{}]]}]}],null]}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"title\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Hayward TigerShark QC Review - The Pool Lab\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Known for its durability and quick cleaning cycle. A workhorse for larger pools.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"4\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Hayward-TigerShark-QC\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Hayward TigerShark QC Review\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Known for its durability and quick cleaning cycle. A workhorse for larger pools.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/W3RC9990CUB/TigerShark_QC_Robotic_Cleaner_RC9990CUB_LEFT_3561.png\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png\"}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a:null\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,""])</script></body></html>